post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
As your user, `lumanin doctor --fix` writes the hotkey, the compositor rule
and autostart (every diff is shown first), or open "Lumanin Settings" from the
app grid.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  echo "A daemon still running the previous version restarts itself on the next press of the hotkey."
}

pre_remove() {
  cat <<'MSG'
Lumanin's hotkey, compositor rule and autostart entry are in your user config
and are not removed by the package. Run `lumanin doctor --unfix` as your user
first if you want them gone; ~/.config/lumanin is left alone either way.
MSG
}
